Open Medical Jev
================

Copyright 2026 Open Medical Jev contributors (https://github.com/FeiLiuEM)

This repository contains code, recipes and documentation for routing-based
decision making over frozen open-weight models. It does not contain, and does
not redistribute, model weights, datasets or evaluation materials.

