Independence
------------
Open Medical Jev is an independent project.
Not affiliated with TypeSafe; "Jev" is their product.
Not affiliated with Medical-OpenJev (fancc28/vindahi), MedJev (JunMa11),
ClinicalJev (xzhou-code), or the OpenJev project. See docs/comparison.md
for a description of the differences and relationships.

Scope and safety
----------------
This project is research software for evaluating supervised "yes/no"
judgments and routing decisions over open models. It is not a medical
device and must not be used for diagnosis or treatment. Outputs are
model-computed probabilities and do not constitute medical advice.
